WEBVTT

00:13:28.916 --> 00:13:32.756
You are paying several policies
on the same event.

00:13:32.796 --> 00:13:34.916
Many of you do that.

00:13:34.956 --> 00:13:37.396
Me included, and I should know better.

00:13:38.996 --> 00:13:40.476
So ...

00:13:41.516 --> 00:13:44.796
This kind of behavior
can get people in debt,

00:13:44.836 --> 00:13:46.596
and even if they don't,

00:13:46.636 --> 00:13:51.396
this is money that we could spend
in far more pleasurable ways, right?

00:13:51.796 --> 00:13:52.996
At least I can.

00:13:54.156 --> 00:13:58.836
But selling peace of mind is a problem
for the insurance companies as well.

00:13:59.356 --> 00:14:00.796
Why?